  "description": "Whimfey is a bold and playful handwritten script font with smooth, flowing strokes and a charming retro feel. Its chunky letterforms, lively curves, and natural connections give designs a warm, friendly personality while keeping the lettering highly readable. Perfect for T-shirt designs, branding, logos, packaging, café signs, greeting cards, stickers, social media graphics, and vintage-inspired projects. Whimfey brings a cheerful handmade touch to both modern and nostalgic designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Whimfey is a bold and playful handwritten script font with smooth, flowing strokes and a charming retro feel. Its chunky letterforms, lively curves, and natural connections give designs a warm, friendly personality while keeping the lettering highly readable. Perfect for T-shirt designs, branding, logos, packaging, café signs, greeting cards, stickers, social media graphics, and vintage-inspired projects. Whimfey brings a cheerful handmade touch to both modern and nostalgic designs.</p>",
